            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu asema hivi juu ya jirani wabaya wa watu wangu: “Wamekigusa kile kilicho changu, kile nilichowapa watu wangu Israeli! Basi nitawangoa kutoka katika nchi yao. Hata watu wa Yuda nitawangoa katika nchi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini baada ya kuwangoa, nitawahurumia tena; nitalirudisha kila taifa katika sehemu yake na katika nchi yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kama watajifunza njia za watu wangu kwa moyo wote, kama wataapa kwa jina langu kwa kusema, ‘Kama aishivyo Mwenyezi-Mungu,’ kama vile walivyowafundisha watu wangu kuapa kwa jina la mungu Baali, basi watajengeka miongoni mwa watu wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini taifa lolote ambalo halitanitii, nitalingoa kabisa na kuliangamiza. Mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nimesema.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
